sequenceDiagram
  participant P as demo page
  participant V as docsFiles (Vite)
  participant D as docs/ on disk
  P->>V: write, If-Match: the version it read
  V->>D: only if still that version
  V-->>P: saved, or 412 "Not saved"
  D-->>V: changed by someone else (watch)
  V-->>P: event stream: new content
  Note over P: unsaved edits are kept
